e>", "section_path": ["1", "1.3", "1.3.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p221", "type": "paragraph", "content": "（2）监测结果统计及评价", "section_path": ["1", "1.3", "1.3.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p222", "type": "paragraph", "content": "声环境质量现状监测结果见表3.3-12。", "section_path": ["1", "1.3", "1.3.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p223", "type": "paragraph", "content": "根据监测结果可知，矿区所在区域声环境质量现状监测数据均满足《声环境质量标准》（GB3096-2008）中的3类标准要求，达到2类标准，区域声环境质量现状较好。", "section_path": ["1", "1.3", "1.3.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p224", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**声环境质量现状监测结果**", "section_path": ["1", "1.3", "1.3.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p225", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.3-12                                                    单位：dB（A）", "section_path": ["1", "1.3", "1.3.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p226", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 监测点编号                                   | 监测点位置                                   |   昼间 |   夜间 | 昼间   | 夜间   |", "section_path": ["1", "1.3", "1.3.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p227", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>监测点编号</th><th>监测点位置</th><th>昼间</th><th>夜间</th><th>昼间</th><th>夜间</th></tr><tr><td>1#</td><td><p>七号井田</p>\\n<p>工业场地北</p></td><td>49.5</td><td>44.5</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>2#</td><td><p>七号井田</p>\\n<p>工业场地东</p></td><td>48.1</td><td>42.8</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>3#</td><td><p>七号井田</p>\\n<p>工业场地西</p></td><td>51.5</td><td>46.9</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>4#</td><td><p>七号井田</p>\\n<p>工业场地南</p></td><td>49.6</td><td>41.6</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>5#</td><td><p>七号井田</p>\\n<p>风井场地东北</p></td><td>50.8</td><td>44.7</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>6#</td><td><p>七号井田</p>\\n<p>风井场地西北</p></td><td>46.8</td><td>43.5</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>7#</td><td><p>七号井田</p>\\n<p>风井场地西南</p></td><td>52.7</td><td>43.5</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>8#</td><td><p>七号井田</p>\\n<p>风井场地东南</p></td><td>49.4</td><td>42.1</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><