 样地号：26                     | 时间：2023/5/17                |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p448", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>样地号：26</th><th>时间：2023/5/17</th></tr><tr><td>海拔：994m</td><td>GPS定位：东经81.64° 北纬44.01°</td></tr><tr><td>总盖度：40%</td><td>平均群落高：5cm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"2\\">位置：评价区东部二号勘查区内</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"2\\">主要植物：伊犁绢蒿、薹草、羊茅</td></tr><tr><td>优势种：伊犁绢蒿</td><td><p>生物量：50.45g/m</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"2\\">样方外植物：薹草、绢蒿、茵陈蒿</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"2\\"></td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p449", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**3.4.5.3 植物资源**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p450", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区地带性植被处于高山草原带和荒漠草原带的过渡区域，以藜科及菊科植物为主。砾质较强的洪积扇及山坡的阳面分布有薹草+角果藜+绢蒿荒漠草原，属于典型的荒漠草原植被之一；水分条件相对较好的荒漠区，与山地草原带相邻，分布有伊犁绢蒿荒漠草原；羊茅草原位于山地草原—荒漠草原过渡区域；另外，评价区还分布有一定面积的有林地，包括榆树、杨树、柳树等。评价区内无国家重点保护野生植物物种，评价区常见植物名录见表3.4-30。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p451", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**评价区常见植物名录**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p452", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-30", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p453", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 植物种         | 拉丁名                                       | 科       | 属         |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p454", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>植物种</th><th>拉丁名</th><th>科</th><th>属</th></tr><tr><td>灰柳</td><td><em><p>Salix cinerea</p></em></td><td>杨柳科</td><td>柳属</td></tr><tr><td>驼绒藜</td><td><em><p>Ceratoides lateens</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>驼绒藜属</td></tr><tr><td>角果藜</td><td><em><p>Ceratocarpus arenarius</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>角果藜属</td></tr><tr><td>灰绿藜</td><td><em><p>Chenopodium glaucum</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>藜属</td></tr><tr><td>木地肤</td><td><em><p>Kichia prostrata</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>地肤属</td></tr><tr><td>小蓬</td><td><em><p>Nanophyton erinaceum</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>小蓬属</td></tr><tr><td>天山猪毛菜</td><td><em><p>Salsola junatovii</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>猪毛菜属</td></tr><tr><td>棉藜</td><td><em><p>Kirilowia Bunge</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>棉藜属</td></tr><tr><td>灰灰菜</td><td><em><p>Chenopodium album</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>藜属</td></tr><tr><td>西伯利亚小檗</td><td><em><p>Berberis sibirica</p></em></td><td>小檗科</td><td>小檗属</td></tr><tr><td>荠菜</td><td><em><p>Capsella bursa-pastoris</p></em></td><td>十字花科</td><td>荠属</td></tr><tr><td>二裂委陵菜</td><td><em><p>Porentilla bifurca</p></em></td><td>蔷薇科</td><td>委陵菜属</td></tr><tr><td>多裂委陵菜</td><td><em><p>Potentilla multifida</p></em></td><td>蔷薇科</td><td>委陵菜属</td></tr><tr><td>腺齿蔷薇</td><td><em><p>Rosa albertii</p></em></td><td>蔷薇科</td><td>蔷薇属</td></tr><tr><td>蒙古绣线菊</td><td><em><p>Spiraea mongolica</p></em></td><td>蔷薇科</td><td>绣线菊属</td></tr><tr><td>骆驼刺</td><td><em><p>Alhagi pseudagi</p></em></td><td>豆科</td><td>骆驼刺属</td></tr><tr><td>紫苜蓿</td><td><em><p>Medicago sativa</p></em></td><td>豆科</td><td>苜蓿属</td></tr><tr><td>伊犁郁金香</td><td><em><p>Tulipa iliensis</p></em></td><td>百合科</td><td>郁金香属</td></tr><tr><td>喜盐鸢尾</td><td><em><p>Iris halophila</p></em></td><td>鸢尾科</td><td>鸢尾属</td></tr><tr><td>二裂棘豆</td><td><em><p>Oxytropis biloba</p></em></td><td>鸢尾科</td><td>棘豆属</td></tr><tr><td>小山蒜</td><td><em><p>Allium pallasii</p></em></td><td>百合科</td><td>葱属</td></tr><tr><td>田旋花</td><td><em><p>Canvolvulusb arvensis</p></em></td><td>旋花科</td><td>旋花属</td></tr><tr><td>软紫草</td><td><em><p>Arnebia euchroma</p></em></td><td>紫草科</td><td>软紫草属</td></tr><tr><td>沙参</td><td><em><p>Adenophora lilifolia</p></em></td><td>桔梗科</td><td>沙参属</td></tr><tr><td>博乐绢蒿</td><td>Seriphidoum borotalense</td><td>菊科</td><td>绢蒿属</td></tr><tr><td>新疆绢蒿</td><td><em><p>Sariphidoum kaschgaricum</p></em></td><td>菊科</td><td>绢蒿属</td></tr><tr><td>伊犁绢蒿</td><td><em><p>Sariphidoum transillense</p></em></td><td>菊科</td><td>绢蒿属</td></tr><tr><td>龙蒿</td><td><em><p>Artemisia dracunculus</p></em></td><td>菊科</td><td>蒿属</td></tr><tr><td>马兰</td><td><em><p>Kalimeris indica</p></em></td><td>菊科</td><td>马兰属</td></tr><tr><td>蒲公英</td><td><em><p>Herba Taraxaci</p></em></td><td>菊科</td><td>蒲公英属</td></tr><tr><td>芨芨草</td><td><em><p>Achnatherum splendens</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>芨芨草属</td></tr><tr><td>冰草</td><td><em><p>Agropyron cristatum</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>冰草属</td></tr><tr><td>看麦娘</td><td><em><p>Alopecurus aequalis</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>看麦娘属</td></tr><tr><td>旱雀麦</td><td><em><p>Bromus tectorum</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>雀麦属</td></tr><tr><td>西伯利亚早熟禾</td><td><em><p>Poa sibirica</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>早熟禾属</td></tr><tr><td>狗尾草</td><td><em><p>Setaria vividis</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>狗尾草属</td></tr><tr><td>沙生针茅</td><td><em><p>Stipa glareosa</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>针茅属</td></tr><tr><td>克氏针茅</td><td><em><p>Stipa ktylovii</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>针茅属</td></tr><tr><td>骆驼蓬</td><td><em><p>Peganum harmala</p></em></td><td>蒺藜科</td><td>骆驼蓬属</td></tr><tr><td>散枝猪毛菜</td><td><em><p>Salsola brachiata Pall</p></em></td><td>藜科</td><td>猪毛菜属</td></tr><tr><td>早熟禾</td><td><em><p>Poa annua L.</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>早熟禾属</td></tr><tr><td>榆树</td><td><em><p>Ulmus pumila L.</p></em></td><td>榆科</td><td>榆属</td></tr><tr><td>红叶婆婆纳</td><td><em><p>Veronica rubrifolia Boiss.</p></em></td><td>车前科</td><td>婆婆纳属</td></tr><tr><td>薹草</td><td><em><p>Carex spp.</p></em></td><td>莎草科</td><td>薹草属</td></tr><tr><td>羊茅</td><td><em><p>Festuca ovina L.</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>羊茅属</td></tr><tr><td>涩芥</td><td><em><p>Strigosella africana (L.) Botsch.</p></em></td><td>十字花科</td><td>涩芥属</td></tr><tr><td>茵陈蒿</td><td><em><p>Artemisia capillaris Thunb.</p></em></td><td>菊科</td><td>蒿属</td></tr><tr><td>丝叶芥</td><td><em><p>Leptaleum filifolium (Willd.) DC.</p></em></td><td>十字花科</td><td>丝叶芥属</td></tr><tr><td>角果毛茛</td><td><em><p>Ceratocephala testiculata (Crantz) Roth</p></em></td><td>毛茛科</td><td>角果毛茛属</td></tr><tr><td>苦豆子</td><td><em><p>Sophora alopecuroides L.</p></em></td><td>豆科</td><td>苦参属</td></tr><tr><td>杏树</td><td><em><p>Prunus armeniaca L.</p></em></td><td>蔷薇科</td><td>李属</td></tr><tr><td>槐树</td><td><em><p>Styphnolobium japonicum (L.) Schott</p></em></td><td>豆科</td><td>槐属</td></tr><tr><td>金丝桃叶绣线菊</td><td><em><p>Spiraea hypericifolia L.</p></em></td><td>蔷薇科</td><td>绣线菊属</td></tr><tr><td>狗牙根</td><td><em><p>Cynodon dactylon (L.) Persoon</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>狗牙根属</td></tr><tr><td>长叶车前</td><td><em><p>Plantago lanceolata L.</p></em></td><td>车前科</td><td>车前属</td></tr><tr><td>芦苇</td><td><em><p>Phragmites australis (Cav.) Trin. ex Steud</p></em></td><td>禾本科</td><td>芦苇属</td></tr><tr><td>节节草</td><td><em><p>Equisetum ramosissimum Desf.</p></em></td><td>木贼科</td><td>木贼属</td></tr><tr><td>沙柳</td><td><em><p>Salix cheilophila</p></em></td><td>杨柳科</td><td>柳属</td></tr><tr><td>多枝柽柳</td><td><em><p>Tamarix ramosissima Ledeb.</p></em></td><td>柽柳科</td><td>柽柳属</td></tr><tr><td>水芹</td><td><em><p>Oenanthe javanica (Blume) DC.</p></em></td><td>伞形科</td><td>水芹属</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p456", "type": "paragraph", "content": "通过遥感解译，结合小区植被分布特征及植被垂直分布特点，根据水热条件及建群种的不同，评价区内划分出六种植被类型。评价区及矿区内植被类型及面积统计见表3.4-31，评价区植被类型分布图见图3.4-8。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p457", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**评价区植被类型及面积统计表**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p458", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-31", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p459", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 植被类型                 | 评价区          | 评价区    | 矿区            | 矿区      |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p460", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th rowspan=\\"2\\">植被类型</th><th colspan=\\"2\\">评价区</th><th colspan=\\"2\\">矿区</th></tr><tr><td><p>面积（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></td><td>比例（%）</td><td><p>面积（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></td><td>比例（%）</td></tr><tr><td>薹草+角果藜+绢蒿荒漠草原</td><td>255.27</td><td>34.89</td><td>242.37</td><td>45.11</td></tr><tr><td>伊犁绢蒿荒漠草原</td><td>100.15</td><td>13.69</td><td>93.06</td><td>17.32</td></tr><tr><td>羊茅草原</td><td>147.27</td><td>20.13</td><td>115.09</td><td>21.42</td></tr><tr><td>榆树、杨树、柳树等有林地</td><td>24.73</td><td>3.38</td><td>14.15</td><td>2.63</td></tr><tr><td>河滩湿地</td><td>10.61</td><td>1.45</td><td>7.27</td><td>1.35</td></tr><tr><td>农作物</td><td>84.52</td><td>11.55</td><td>31.76</td><td>5.91</td></tr><tr><td>无植被区</td><td>109.03</td><td>14.90</td><td>34.65</td><td>6.45</td></tr><tr><td>合计</td><td>731.57</td><td>100.00</td><td>538.34</td><td>100.00</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p461", "type": "paragraph", "content": "①薹草+角果藜+伊犁绢蒿荒漠草原", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p462", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区薹草+角果藜+伊犁绢蒿荒漠草原属于地带性植被类型，占整个评价区的34.89%。群落外貌单调、结构简单，群落盖度为20%～40%左右，草高5～15cm。主要建群物种为薹草、角果藜、伊犁绢蒿、博乐绢蒿，伴生种为羊茅、蒲公英、涩芥、茵陈蒿、丝状芥、角果毛茛、红叶婆婆纳等。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p463", "type": "paragraph", "content": "②伊犁绢蒿荒漠草原", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p464", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区伊犁绢蒿荒漠草原占整个评价区的13.69%，群落盖度为40%～60%之间，草高10～30cm。主要建群种为伊犁绢蒿，常见伴生种有羊茅、蒲公英、涩芥、茵陈蒿、丝状芥、红叶婆婆纳、苦豆子、旱雀麦、芨芨草、骆驼蓬、金丝桃叶绣线菊等。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p465", "type": "paragraph", "content": "③羊茅草原", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p466", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区羊茅草原占整个评价区的20.13%，群落盖度20%～40%，草高5～10cm，种类组成比较丰富，优势种为羊茅，次要优势种有蒲公英、涩芥，其他伴生种有茵陈蒿、丝叶芥、角果毛茛、红叶婆婆纳等。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p467", "type": "paragraph", "content": "④榆树、杨树、柳树等有林地", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p468", "type": "paragraph", "content": "另外，评价区内分布有小面积林地，种植有榆树、杨树、柳树等人工林。评价区林地面积为24.73 km 2 ，占评价区面积的3.38%。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p469", "type": "paragraph", "content": "⑤河滩湿地", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p470", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区河滩湿地面积为10.61 km 2 ，占评价区面积的1.45%。河滩湿地主要分布在评价区河流两岸，生长有柳灌、杨树、榆树等乔木林，以及多枝柽柳等灌木，草本包括芦苇、节节草、薹草、苦豆子、沙柳、长叶车前、水芹等。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p471", "type": "paragraph", "content": "⑥农作物", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p472", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区农作物主要分布在评价区西部和南部，种植的农作物包括冬小麦、玉米、油菜等。评价区农作物面积为84.52 km 2 ，占评价区面积的11.55%。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p473", "type": "paragraph", "content": "由于矿区开发多年，加上气候变化和过度放牧，评价区植被有一定的退化。因此在矿区开发过程中，应该及时采取土地复垦工作，尽早恢复人工植被，通过对植被的后期人为管护工作和植被长期的自然演替能够恢复植被覆盖度和生物量，保证生态系统的稳定性和完整性。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.5.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p476", "type": "paragraph", "content": "伊犁谷地的野生动物，在中国动物地理区划中属古北界、中亚亚界、哈萨克斯坦区、伊塔亚区、巴尔喀什小区。评价区在山前丘陵区，区域内地表覆盖度较差，多为蒿类和藜属荒漠草原。由于近些年来城镇的扩张和频繁的人为活动及矿产开发，评价区范围内野生动物种类、数量已很少。本次评价于2022年对评价区野生动物进行了样线调查，共布设8条样线，调查期间未发现国家及自治区级保护野生动物。评价范围内常见的兽类为草兔、小五指跳鼠、灰仓鼠、三趾跳鼠和大沙鼠等，未见国家及自治区级保护野生动物。评价区野生动物样线布设见图3.4-9。现场调查照片见图3.4-10。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p477", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| ![image_1777640839478665.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640844528879_image_1777640839478665.png)       | ![image_1777640839480437.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640844669550_image_1777640839480437.png)       |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p478", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th></th><th></th></tr><tr><td>动物样线内的动物毛发</td><td>动物样线内的动物粪便</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"2\\">样线</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>动物样线内的鸟类</td><td>动物样线内的动物毛发</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>动物样线内的洞穴</td><td>动物样线内的鸟类羽毛</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"2\\">样线</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"2\\">样线</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"2\\">样线</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p479", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**图3.4-10  野生动物调查现场照片**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p480", "type": "paragraph", "content": "另外，评价区可能出现保护野生动物，主要包括国家一级保护动物有1种（四爪陆龟），二级保护动物5种（赤狐、兔狲，燕隼、灰背隼、红隼）。四爪陆龟主要分布在评价区西北部的新疆霍城四爪陆龟国家级自然保护区，主要生境为藜属和短命蒿属植物为主的黏土荒漠地带。鸟类主要栖息在评价区北部的山区，偶尔会出现在评价区内。评价区主要野生动物名录见表3.4-32。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p481", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**评价区内主要野生动物名录**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p482", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-32", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p483", "type": "paragraph", "content": "|   序号 | 动物名称     | 拉丁学名                                  | 纲       | 目       | 科       | 保护等级   |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p484", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>序号</th><th>动物名称</th><th>拉丁学名</th><th>纲</th><th>目</th><th>科</th><th>保护等级</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>旱地沙蜥</td><td><em><p>Phrynocephalus helioscopus</p></em></td><td>爬行纲</td><td>蜥蜴目</td><td>鬣蜥科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>伊犁沙虎</td><td><em><p>Teratoscincus scicus</p></em></td><td>爬行纲</td><td>蜥蜴目</td><td>壁虎科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>网纹麻蜥</td><td><em><p>Eremias grammica</p></em></td><td>爬行纲</td><td>蜥蜴目</td><td>蜥蜴科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>花脊遊蛇</td><td><em><p>Coluber ravergier</p></em></td><td>爬行纲</td><td>蛇目</td><td>游蛇科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>白条锦蛇</td><td><em><p>Elaphe dione</p></em></td><td>爬行纲</td><td>蛇目</td><td>游蛇科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>黑腹沙鸡</td><td><em><p>Pterocles orientalis</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>鹳形目</td><td>沙鸡科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>毛腿沙鸡</td><td><em><p>Syrrhaptes paradoxus</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>鹳形目</td><td>沙鸡科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>夜鹰</td><td><em><p>Caprimulgus sp.</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>夜鹰目</td><td>夜鹰科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>灰斑鸠</td><td><em><p>Streptopelia decaocto</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>鸽形目</td><td>鸠鸽科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>大杜鹃</td><td><em><p>Cuculus canorus</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>鹃形目</td><td>杜鹃科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>兰胸佛法僧</td><td><em><p>Coracias garrulus</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>佛法僧目</td><td>佛法僧科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>戴胜</td><td><em><p>Upupa epops</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>佛法僧目</td><td>戴胜科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>角百灵</td><td><em><p>Eremophila alpestris</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>雀形目</td><td>百灵科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>塔里木蟾蜍</td><td><em><p>Bufo pewzowi</p></em></td><td>两栖纲</td><td>无尾目</td><td>蟾蜍科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>中亚侧褶蛙</td><td><em><p>Pelophylax terentievi</p></em></td><td>两栖纲</td><td>无尾目</td><td>蛙科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>灰仓鼠</td><td><em><p>Cricetulus migratorius</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>啮齿目</td><td>仓鼠科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>普通田鼠</td><td><em><p>Microtus arvalis</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>啮齿目</td><td>仓鼠科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>小家鼠</td><td><em><p>Mus musculus</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>啮齿目</td><td>鼠科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>草兔</td><td><em><p>Lepus tolai</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>兔型目</td><td>兔科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>小五指跳鼠</td><td><em><p>Allactaga elater</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>啮齿目</td><td>跳鼠科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>21</td><td>三趾跳鼠</td><td><em><p>Dipus sagitta</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>啮齿目</td><td>跳鼠科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>22</td><td>大沙鼠</td><td><em><p>Rhombomys opimus</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>啮齿目</td><td>仓鼠科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>23</td><td>燕隼</td><td><em><p>FalcosubbuteoLinnaeus</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>隼形目</td><td>隼科</td><td>国家Ⅱ级</td></tr><tr><td>24</td><td>灰背隼</td><td><em><p>Falcocolumbarius innaeus</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>隼形目</td><td>隼科</td><td>国家Ⅱ级</td></tr><tr><td>25</td><td>红隼</td><td><em><p>Falco tinnunculus</p></em></td><td>鸟纲</td><td>隼形目</td><td>隼科</td><td>国家Ⅱ级</td></tr><tr><td>26</td><td>四爪陆龟</td><td><em><p>Testudo horsfisldi</p></em></td><td>爬行纲</td><td>龟鳖目</td><td>陆龟科</td><td>国家Ⅰ级</td></tr><tr><td>27</td><td>兔狲</td><td><em><p>Felis maunl</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>食肉目</td><td>猫科</td><td>国家Ⅱ级</td></tr><tr><td>28</td><td>赤狐</td><td><em><p>Vulpes vulpes</p></em></td><td>哺乳纲</td><td>食肉目</td><td>犬科</td><td>国家Ⅱ级</td></tr><tr><td>29</td><td>新疆裸重唇鱼</td><td><em><p>Gymnodiptychus dybowskii</p></em></td><td>硬骨鱼纲</td><td>鲤形目</td><td>鲤科</td><td>自治区Ⅰ级</td></tr><tr><td>30</td><td>伊犁裂腹鱼</td><td><em><p>Schizothorax （Racoma） pseudaksaiensis</p></em></td><td>硬骨鱼纲</td><td>鲤形目</td><td>鲤科</td><td>自治区Ⅱ级</td></tr><tr><td>31</td><td>黑斑高原鳅</td><td><em><p>Triplophysa strauchii</p></em></td><td>硬骨鱼纲</td><td>鲤形目</td><td>鳅科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>32</td><td>斯氏高原鳅</td><td><em><p>Triplophysa stoliczkae</p></em></td><td>硬骨鱼纲</td><td>鲤形目</td><td>鳅科</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>33</td><td>黑背高原鳅</td><td><em><p>Triplophysa dorsalis</p></em></td><td>硬骨鱼纲</td><td>鲤形目</td><td>鳅科</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p486", "type": "paragraph", "content": "2023年9月，新疆维吾尔自治区林业规划院编制了《伊北矿区四爪陆龟调查报告》（附录4），对临近新疆霍城四爪陆龟国家级自然保护区的四号井田、肖尔布拉克井田、肖尔布拉克西井田、一号勘查区以及外扩5 km范围内的新疆霍城四爪陆龟国家级自然保护区保护动物四爪陆龟分布情况开展了实地调查。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p487", "type": "paragraph", "content": "调查报告对四爪陆龟分布情况得出如下结论：", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p488", "type": "paragraph", "content": "（1）矿区及其附近5 km范围内不是四爪陆龟的主要活动区域。根据现状调查，可能是由于矿区开发对四爪陆龟的干扰距离减小所致，矿区未发现四爪陆龟活动，项目调查区内的野生动物种类和数量分布较为稀少，区域内无大型野生动物的繁殖及栖息地，常见动物主要为爬行类和啮齿类以及适应人类活动的鸟类，且多为荒漠广布种。根据现状调查和霍城四爪陆龟自然保护区野生动物调查监测数据，矿区开发范围不是四爪陆龟的主要活动区域。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p489", "type": "paragraph", "content": "（2）项目调查区缺乏四爪陆龟主要喜食植物。经调查，矿区范围及周边5 km范围内鲜有四爪陆龟喜食的植物拉拉藤、苜蓿、紫菀、小麦、玉米等植物分布，因此该区域基本不会成为四爪陆龟分布区。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p490", "type": "paragraph", "content": "（3）受多种因素影响，四爪陆龟分布区减少。矿区周边区域曾有大量四爪陆龟分布，但近年来由于气候变化、人类开发活动等因素的影响，四爪陆龟分布区缩减。该区植被分布稀疏，无法给四爪陆龟提供更多食源植物和隐蔽活动空间，矿区周边区域不是四爪陆龟主要栖息地。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p491", "type": "paragraph", "content": "（4）项目调查区在调查期内没有发现四爪陆龟活动痕迹。本次在调查区域通过红外相机、样线调查、访问调查，没有发现四爪陆龟有在该区域活动痕迹，查阅近三年历史文献也没有发现有四爪陆龟活动记录，这和现状调查情况基本吻合。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p492", "type": "paragraph", "content": "（5）伊北矿区开发建设对四爪陆龟的栖息地影响程度有限。与四爪陆龟保护区内的相关因素比较，调查区域的土壤类型未发生明显变化，水源地水深减少（可能是区域气候变化原因），植被盖度没产生显著变化，落叶厚度没有显著变化，四爪陆龟潜在活动主要地类为灌木林地和天然牧草地，这两类地类占地面积为574.46 km 2 ，占调查区面积78.52%，区域植被分布均较为稀少，缺少四爪陆龟食用、隐蔽、栖息和繁殖区域，不适宜陆龟栖息生存。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p493", "type": "paragraph", "content": "总体上认为，项目调查区不是四爪陆龟的主要分布区，四爪陆龟主要受到干扰距离、土壤性质、食源性植物、水源水深的影响，但是这几个矿区对这几个因素影响不显著，矿区现有四爪陆龟分布影响属于既有影响，因此伊北矿区开发建设基本上不会对现有四爪陆龟种群产生影响。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.6.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p495", "type": "paragraph", "content": "土壤类型受地形、地貌、成土母质、气候、植被等因素的影响，根据《中国土壤分类与代码》（GB/T17296-2009），评价区域地带性土壤为灰钙土，非地带性土壤类型包括栗钙土和草甸土。灰钙土为评价区面积最大、分布最广泛的土壤类型，分布于海拔700—1200m的低山丘陵区。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p496", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区土壤类型分布情况见图3.4-11，评价区及矿区土壤类型及面积统计见表3.4-33。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p497", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**评价区土壤类型面积统计表**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p498", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-33", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p499", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 土壤类型   | 评价区          | 评价区    | 矿区            | 矿区      |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p500", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th rowspan=\\"2\\">土壤类型</th><th colspan=\\"2\\">评价区</th><th colspan=\\"2\\">矿区</th></tr><tr><td><p>面积（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></td><td>比例（%）</td><td><p>面积（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></td><td>比例（%）</td></tr><tr><td>灰钙土</td><td>573.58</td><td>78.40</td><td>445.86</td><td>82.82</td></tr><tr><td>栗钙土</td><td>88.22</td><td>12.06</td><td>52.04</td><td>9.67</td></tr><tr><td>草甸土</td><td>69.77</td><td>9.54</td><td>40.44</td><td>7.51</td></tr><tr><td>合计</td><td>731.57</td><td>100.00</td><td>538.34</td><td>100.00</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p501", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区内灰钙土面积为573.58 km 2 ，占评价区面积的78.40%。灰钙土是暖温带荒漠草原区弱淋溶的 [干旱土](http://baike.baidu.com/view/939014.htm) ，表层弱腐殖化， [土壤](http://baike.baidu.com/view/26545.htm) 有机质含量1%-2.5%，15-30 cm处为假菌丝状或斑点状的 [钙积层](http://baike.baidu.com/view/1512072.htm) ，剖面中下部还可出现石膏淀积层与可溶盐 [淀积层](http://baike.baidu.com/view/944835.htm) 。剖面构型与 [棕钙土](http://baike.baidu.com/view/343242.htm) 近似，但干旱程度稍低，淋溶略强，且因多发育于黄土母质，土层通常较深厚。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p502", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区的灰钙土目前有三种利用方式：作为天然放牧场，主要于春秋季节放牧用（以牧羊为主），这是评价区主要利用方式；开垦为旱作农田，这种利用方式较少；在有水源条件地区开辟为灌溉农田，主要在河谷低地地区。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p503", "type": "paragraph", "content": "用作天然牧场的灰钙土，当前普遍存在的主要问题是放牧利用过度，从而引起土壤侵蚀和土壤退化，应适当限制载畜量。作为旱作农田的灰钙土主要种植春小麦。由于降水不足，一般产量不高，且极不稳定，近年来有些已“退耕还牧”。作为灌溉农田的灰钙土虽然获得较高生产力，但由于长期连作，耕作粗放，导致土壤肥力降低，应当增加牧草及豆科作物比重，合理轮作，增施肥料，精耕细作，以不断提高土壤肥力和作物产量。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.7"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p505", "type": "paragraph", "content": "根据《新疆维吾尔自治区水土保持规划》（2018—2030年），评价区所在地属于重点治理区。评价区地表植被主要为蒿属草原，土壤侵蚀类型主要以水力侵蚀为主，兼有风力侵蚀。评价区水蚀原因来自季节性暴雨及融雪水形成的洪水冲刷及淋溶，因该地植被盖度低，暴雨易造成地表土壤侵蚀，主要是夏季暴雨造成地表水土流失，在沟谷中易形成泥浆似的洪水。但因评价区坡度不大，不易形成泥石流等大的水土流失现象。在春季融雪期气温升高，在强烈日光照射下，也可产生地面径流及侵蚀，但要比暴雨侵蚀程度轻。水力侵蚀强度分级标准见表3.4-34，风力侵蚀强度分级依据见表3.4-35。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p506", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**水力侵蚀强度分级标准**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p507", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-34", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p508", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 侵蚀等级   | 沟壑密度  （km/km  2  ）   | 沟壑所占面积  （%）   | 植被盖度  （%）   | 侵蚀模数  （t/km  2  •a）   | 侵蚀深度  （mm/a）   |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p509", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>侵蚀等级</th><th><p>沟壑密度</p>\\n<p>（km/km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></th><th><p>沟壑所占面积</p>\\n<p>（%）</p></th><th><p>植被盖度</p>\\n<p>（%）</p></th><th><p>侵蚀模数</p>\\n<p>（t/km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>•a）</p></th><th><p>侵蚀深度</p>\\n<p>（mm/a）</p></th></tr><tr><td>微度侵蚀</td><td>&lt;0.5-1.0</td><td>&lt;5-10</td><td>&gt;90</td><td>&lt;200</td><td>&lt;0.16</td></tr><tr><td>轻度侵蚀</td><td>1.0-3.0</td><td>10-25</td><td>65-90</td><td>200-2500</td><td>0.16-2.0</td></tr><tr><td>中度侵蚀</td><td>2.0-4.0</td><td>20-35</td><td>40-65</td><td>2500-5000</td><td>2.0-4.0</td></tr><tr><td>强烈侵蚀</td><td>3.0-5.0</td><td>30-45</td><td>20-40</td><td>5000-8000</td><td>4.0-6.0</td></tr><tr><td>极强烈侵蚀</td><td>&gt;5.0</td><td>&gt;45</td><td>&lt;20</td><td>8000-15000</td><td>6.0-12.0</td></tr><tr><td>剧烈侵蚀</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>&gt;15000</td><td>&gt;12.0</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p510", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**风力侵蚀强度分级指标**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p511", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-35", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p512", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 侵蚀强度   | 床面形态（地表形态）       | 植被覆盖度（%）  （非流沙面积）   | 风蚀厚度  （mm/a）   | 侵蚀模数  [t/（km  2  ·a）]   |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p513", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>侵蚀强度</th><th>床面形态（地表形态）</th><th><p>植被覆盖度（%）</p>\\n<p>（非流沙面积）</p></th><th><p>风蚀厚度</p>\\n<p>（mm/a）</p></th><th><p>侵蚀模数</p>\\n<p>[t/（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>·a）]</p></th></tr><tr><td>微度侵蚀</td><td>固定沙丘，沙地和滩地</td><td>＞70</td><td>＜2</td><td>＜200</td></tr><tr><td>轻度侵蚀</td><td>固定沙丘，半固定沙丘，沙地</td><td>70-50</td><td>2-10</td><td>200-2500</td></tr><tr><td>中度侵蚀</td><td>半固定沙丘，沙地</td><td>50-30</td><td>10-25</td><td>2500-5000</td></tr><tr><td>强烈侵蚀</td><td>半固定沙丘，流动沙丘，沙地</td><td>30-10</td><td>25-50</td><td>5000-8000</td></tr><tr><td>极强烈侵蚀</td><td>流动沙丘，沙地</td><td>＜10</td><td>20-100</td><td>8000-15000</td></tr><tr><td>剧烈侵蚀</td><td>大片流动沙丘</td><td>＜10</td><td>＞100</td><td>＞15000</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p514", "type": "paragraph", "content": "通过实地调查，主要考虑地面坡度和地表植被覆盖度两个因素，进行区域土壤侵蚀分类分级。依据侵蚀模数的大小对土壤侵蚀强度进行分级，分别为微度侵蚀、轻度侵蚀、中度侵蚀、强烈侵蚀四个等级。评价区及矿区土壤侵蚀强度面积统计见表3.4-36，评价区土壤侵蚀强度图见图3.4-12。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p515", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**评价区土壤侵蚀类型及面积统计表**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p516", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-36", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p517", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 侵蚀类型   | 评价区          | 评价区    | 矿区            | 矿区      |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p518", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th rowspan=\\"2\\">侵蚀类型</th><th colspan=\\"2\\">评价区</th><th colspan=\\"2\\">矿区</th></tr><tr><td><p>面积（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></td><td>比例（%）</td><td><p>面积（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></td><td>比例（%）</td></tr><tr><td>微度侵蚀</td><td>38.87</td><td>5.31</td><td>11.93</td><td>2.22</td></tr><tr><td>轻度侵蚀</td><td>203.57</td><td>27.83</td><td>142.01</td><td>26.38</td></tr><tr><td>中度侵蚀</td><td>355.42</td><td>48.58</td><td>335.75</td><td>62.37</td></tr><tr><td>强烈侵蚀</td><td>133.70</td><td>18.28</td><td>48.65</td><td>9.04</td></tr><tr><td>共计</td><td>731.57</td><td>100.00</td><td>538.34</td><td>100.00</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p519", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区内土壤侵蚀强度以中度侵蚀为主，占评价区面积的48.58%。由于开采多年，评价区存在强烈侵蚀区域，主要分布在露天矿采掘场和外排土场。评价区强烈侵蚀面积占评价区面积的18.28%。因此矿区开发的同时，应及时采取土地复垦措施，保护草地植被，提高植被盖度，降低土壤侵蚀强度。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.8"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p522", "type": "paragraph", "content": "评价区内以草地生态系统占绝对优势，广泛分布于整个评价区内。评价区内草地生态系统面积为549.72km 2 ，占评价区面积的75.14%。矿区开发多年，因此评价区分布有一定面积的城镇生态系统和农田生态系统，面积分别为60.92km 2 和85.16km 2 ，分别占评价区面积的8.33%和11.64%。另外，评价区还分布有小面积的森林生态系统、灌丛生态系统和湿地生态系统，面积分别为13.19km 2 、11.56km 2 和10.61km 2 ，分别占评价区面积的1.80%、1.58%和1.45%，小面积无序地分布于草地生态系统中。评价区2022年生态系统类型图见图3.4-13。评价区2022年生态系统类型及面积统计表见表3.4-37。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p523", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**评价区及矿区生态系统类型及面积统计表**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p524", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-37", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p525", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 分类         | 评价区          | 评价区    | 矿区            | 矿区      |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p526", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th rowspan=\\"2\\">分类</th><th colspan=\\"2\\">评价区</th><th colspan=\\"2\\">矿区</th></tr><tr><td><p>面积（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></td><td>比例（%）</td><td><p>面积（km</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>）</p></td><td>比例（%）</td></tr><tr><td>森林生态系统</td><td>13.19</td><td>1.80</td><td>5.87</td><td>1.09</td></tr><tr><td>草地生态系统</td><td>549.72</td><td>75.14</td><td>450.52</td><td>83.69</td></tr><tr><td>农田生态系统</td><td>85.16</td><td>11.64</td><td>31.76</td><td>5.90</td></tr><tr><td>灌丛生态系统</td><td>11.56</td><td>1.58</td><td>8.29</td><td>1.54</td></tr><tr><td>城镇生态系统</td><td>60.92</td><td>8.33</td><td>34.46</td><td>6.40</td></tr><tr><td>湿地生态系统</td><td>10.61</td><td>1.45</td><td>7.27</td><td>1.35</td></tr><tr><td>其他</td><td>0.41</td><td>0.06</td><td>0.18</td><td>0.03</td></tr><tr><td>合计</td><td>731.57</td><td>100.00</td><td>538.34</td><td>100.00</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.1"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p528", "type": "paragraph", "content": "景观生态体系的质量现状是由区域内自然环境、各种生物以及人类社会之间复杂的相互作用来决定的。从景观生态学结构与功能相匹配的观点出发，结构是否合理可以决定了景观功能状况的优劣。本次生态环境质量评价采用景观生态学理论来评价项目评价区的生态质量，采用传统生态学中优势度值法，通过计算各拼块的优势度，确定生态系统中的模地，对评价区环境质量状况作出判定，在景观的三组分（缀块、廊道和模地）中，模地是景观的背景区域，是一种重要的景观元素类型，在很大程度上决定了景观的性质，对景观的动态起着主导作用。判定模地有三个标准，即相对面积要大、连通程度要高、具有动态控制能力。对景观模地的判定一般采用生态学中重要值的方法决定某一缀块在景观中的优势（优势度值），其计算如下：", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p529", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507489.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640846604942_image_1777640839507489.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p530", "type": "paragraph", "content": "式中：", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p531", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507497.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640846729388_image_1777640839507497.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p532", "type": "paragraph", "content": "——为优势度；", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p533", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507503.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640846845563_image_1777640839507503.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p534", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507513.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640846972947_image_1777640839507513.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p535", "type": "paragraph", "content": "——拼块密度，其计算式为：；", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p536", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507519.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640847116611_image_1777640839507519.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p537", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507527.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640847235937_image_1777640839507527.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p538", "type": "paragraph", "content": "——频率，其计算式为：，以1000m×1000m为一个样方；", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p539", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507531.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640847354830_image_1777640839507531.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p540", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507539.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640847474729_image_1777640839507539.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p541", "type": "paragraph", "content": "——景观比例，其计算式为：。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p542", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507544.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640847612894_image_1777640839507544.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p543", "type": "paragraph", "content": "伊北矿区生态评价范围面积为731.57 km 2 ，按1000 m1000 m对评价范围进行样方划分，共计样方1357个，按照优势度计算公式计算后，结果见表3.4-38。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p544", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**评价区各类缀块优势度值**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p545", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-38", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p546", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 缀块类型                                       | R  d  （%）                                    | R  f  （%）                                    | L  p  （%）                                    | D  o  （%）                                    |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p547", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>缀块类型</th><th><p>R</p>\\n<sub><p>d</p></sub>\\n<p>（%）</p></th><th><p>R</p>\\n<sub><p>f</p></sub>\\n<p>（%）</p></th><th><p>L</p>\\n<sub><p>p</p></sub>\\n<p>（%）</p></th><th><p>D</p>\\n<sub><p>o</p></sub>\\n<p>（%）</p></th></tr><tr><td>林地</td><td>3.01</td><td>3.92</td><td>3.38</td><td>3.42</td></tr><tr><td>耕地</td><td>9.26</td><td>6.49</td><td>6.79</td><td>7.33</td></tr><tr><td>园地</td><td>6.05</td><td>2.95</td><td>3.89</td><td>4.20</td></tr><tr><td>草地</td><td>74.06</td><td>88.30</td><td>75.14</td><td>78.16</td></tr><tr><td>工矿仓储用地</td><td>2.85</td><td>1.11</td><td>4.11</td><td>3.05</td></tr><tr><td>住宅用地</td><td>0.98</td><td>1.03</td><td>1.69</td><td>1.35</td></tr><tr><td>交通运输用地</td><td>1.02</td><td>8.42</td><td>1.47</td><td>3.10</td></tr><tr><td>水域及水利设施用地</td><td>0.59</td><td>0.67</td><td>1.59</td><td>1.11</td></tr><tr><td>公共管理与公共服务用地</td><td>0.08</td><td>0.20</td><td>0.19</td><td>0.17</td></tr><tr><td>商服用地</td><td>0.07</td><td>0.20</td><td>0.06</td><td>0.10</td></tr><tr><td>特殊用地</td><td>0.02</td><td>0.10</td><td>0.78</td><td>0.42</td></tr><tr><td>其他土地</td><td>2.01</td><td>2.81</td><td>0.14</td><td>1.28</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"5\\">注：Rd —密度；Rf —频率；Lp—景观比率；Do—优势度</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p548", "type": "paragraph", "content": "由表3.4-38数据显示，在上述景观类型中，草地是环境资源拼块中对生态环境质量调控能力最强的高亚稳定性元素类型，其优势度最高，达到了78.16%，连通程度也较高（R d 为74.06%，R f 为88.30%）。除了草地以外，优势度较高的还有林地、耕地、园地，工矿仓储用地、交通运输用地和住宅用地，优势度也分别达到了3.42%、7.34%、4.63%、3.05%、3.10%、1.35%，对环境质量也具有较强的调控能力。说明该区域受到人为干扰，干扰程度较强。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.2"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p550", "type": "paragraph", "content": "生态完整性是生态系统维持各生态因子相互关系并达到最佳状态的自然特性，反映了生态系统的健康程度。运用景观生态学的原理与方法对区域的生态完整性现状进行评价，即从生态系统生产力和稳定性两个方面对该区域生态系统的结构和功能状况进行分析。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p551", "type": "paragraph", "content": "（1）生态系统生产力评价", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p552", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507551.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640847740593_image_1777640839507551.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p553", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507554.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640847856232_image_1777640839507554.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p554", "type": "paragraph", "content": "根据NPP与植物吸收的光合有效辐射（APAR）和植物将所吸收的光合有效辐射转化为有机物的关系构建基于遥感卫星数据的NPP估算模型，即NPP可以由植物吸收的光合有效辐射（）和光利用率（）2个因子来表示，其估算公式如下：", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p555", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507561.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640847975527_image_1777640839507561.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p556", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507565.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640848127965_image_1777640839507565.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p557", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507570.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640848258644_image_1777640839507570.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p558", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507574.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640848370650_image_1777640839507574.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p559", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507578.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640848504085_image_1777640839507578.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p560", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507582.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640848633799_image_1777640839507582.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p561", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507586.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640848765363_image_1777640839507586.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p562", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507589.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640848894072_image_1777640839507589.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p563", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507592.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640849016390_image_1777640839507592.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p564", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507595.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640849136782_image_1777640839507595.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p565", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507599.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640849262776_image_1777640839507599.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p566", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507602.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640849390653_image_1777640839507602.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p567", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507605.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640849525199_image_1777640839507605.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p568", "type": "paragraph", "content": "式中，表示时间，表示空间位置；（，）表示像元在月份吸收的光合有效辐射（MJ/m 2 /月）；（，）表示像元在月份的实际光能利用率（g/MJ）。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p569", "type": "paragraph", "content": "植被吸收的光合有效辐射取决于太阳总辐射和植物本身的特征，光合有效辐射（APAR）的估算用下式计算。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p570", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507611.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640849646261_image_1777640839507611.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p571", "type": "paragraph", "content": "式中：SOL（x，t）表示t月在像元x处的太阳总辐射量（MJ/m 2 ）；FPAR（x，t）为植被层对入射光合有效辐射的吸收比例；常数0.5表示植被所能利用的太阳有效辐射（波长为0.38～0.71μm）占太阳总辐射的比例。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p572", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507615.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640849770674_image_1777640839507615.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p573", "type": "paragraph", "content": "环境因子如气温、土壤水分状况以及大气水汽压差等会通过影响植物的光合能力而调节植被的NPP。在遥感模型中，这些因子对NPP的调控是通过对最大光能利用率进行调节而实现的。光能利用率的估算用下式计算：", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p574", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507622.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640849905619_image_1777640839507622.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p575", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507628.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640850033248_image_1777640839507628.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p576", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507632.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640850150312_image_1777640839507632.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p577", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507637.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640850270517_image_1777640839507637.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p578", "type": "paragraph", "content": "![image_1777640839507640.png](http://localhost:9000/public/unknown/kb-images/1777640850403300_image_1777640839507640.png)", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p579", "type": "paragraph", "content": "式中，和表示低温和高温对光能利用率的胁迫作用；为水分胁迫影响系数，反映水分条件的影响；是理想条件下的最大光能利用率（gC·MJ -1 ）。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p580", "type": "paragraph", "content": "为了充分了解评价区生产力水平，通过NPP估算模型计算出评价区生态系统净第一性生产力，按照奥德姆划分法，将地球上生态系统按照生产力的高低划分为4个等级，见表3.4-39，以此判别评价区内植被的生产力水平。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p581", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**地球上生态系统生产力水平等级划分**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p582", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-39", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p583", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 评价等级   | 生产力判断标准gC/（m  2  .a）   | 生态类型举例                                                     |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p584", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>评价等级</th><th><p>生产力判断标准gC/（m</p>\\n<sup><p>2</p></sup>\\n<p>.a）</p></th><th>生态类型举例</th></tr><tr><td>最低</td><td>＜182.50</td><td>荒漠和深海</td></tr><tr><td>较低</td><td>182.50 ~ 1080</td><td>山地森林、热带稀树草原、某些农耕地、半干旱草原、深湖和大陆架</td></tr><tr><td>较高</td><td>1080 ~ 3600</td><td>热带雨林、农耕地和浅湖</td></tr><tr><td>最高</td><td>3600 ~ 7200</td><td>少数特殊生态系统、如农业高产用、河漫滩、三角洲、珊瑚礁和红树林等</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p585", "type": "paragraph", "content": "通过计算，评价区内2022年的平均净第一性生产力为202.84 gC/（m 2 .a），处于182.50 ~ 1080gC/（m 2 .a）的判断标准内，属于全球生态系统生产力“较低”水平，说明由于评价区受气候和人类活动等因素的影响，植被生产力较低。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p586", "type": "paragraph", "content": "（2）生态系统稳定性评价", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p587", "type": "paragraph", "content": "生态系统稳定性包括两种特征，即生态系统对干扰的阻抗能力和受到干扰后的恢复能力。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p588", "type": "paragraph", "content": "1）恢复稳定性分析", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p589", "type": "paragraph", "content": "生态系统的恢复稳定性可通过植被的生产力去衡量。植被生产力越大，则生态系统受干扰后恢复到原状的能力就越强。评价区内林地生产力最大，其恢复稳定性最强，但在评价区所占比例仅为3.38%，因此对区域生态系统稳定性有一定的贡献。评价区内分布面积最大的植被类型为荒漠草原，在评价区所占比例达到了48.58%，生产力为100.52 gC/m 2 ·a，对区域稳定贡献最大，是评价区内决定生态系统稳定程度的重要类型。可以看出评价区生产力高且稳定性较强的斑块在评价区内占有比例较小，荒漠草原的占比达到了50%左右，因此评价区具有一定的恢复稳定性，但恢复稳定性不强。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p590", "type": "paragraph", "content": "2）生态系统阻抗稳定性", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p591", "type": "paragraph", "content": "生态系统的阻抗稳定性与植被的异质化程度密切。通过对评价区内植被类型分布的分析，评价区内植被主要为荒漠草原，其中评价区内分布面积最大的植被类型为薹草+角果藜+绢蒿荒漠草原和伊犁绢蒿荒漠草原，在评价区所占比例达到了48.58%，该植被类型以一年生草本为优势物种，该群落稳定性较低，因此评价区生态系统阻抗稳定性较低。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p592", "type": "paragraph", "content": "综合分析表明，评价区生态系统生产力处于较低水平，恢复稳定性不强，阻抗稳定性不强。在受到煤矿开采、过度放牧等人类活动干扰后，也可能会向更低等级退化。因此矿区开发利用的同时，应该及时采取土地复垦工作，通过人工恢复和自然演替恢复植被覆盖度和生物量，逐渐恢复生态系统的稳定性和完整性。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.3"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p594", "type": "paragraph", "content": "本次评价对评价区动植物现状进行了现场调查，通过样方、样线的调查方法，结合遥感解译技术，对评价区生态系统生物多样性进行评价。根据《环境影响评价技术导则 生态影响》（HJ19-2022）中推荐的生物多样性评价方法，选用Shannon-Weaver多样性指数来进行估算，该指标既考虑了不同群落类型所占景观总面积的大小及分布的均匀程度，又考虑了群落类型的多少。Shannon-Weaver多样性指数：", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.4"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p595", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<!-- image -->", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.4"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p596", "type": "paragraph", "content": "式中：P k 代表斑块类型k在景观中出现的概率；n代表景观中斑块类型的总数。生物多样性统计见表3.4-40。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.4"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p597", "type": "paragraph", "content": "**评价区内群落多样性统计**", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.4"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p598", "type": "paragraph", "content": "表3.4-40", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.4"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p599", "type": "paragraph", "content": "| 类型                           |   *P*  *k*  𝑃𝑘  （%） |   <!-- image --> |", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.4"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p600", "type": "paragraph", "content": "<table><tbody><tr><th>类型</th><th><em><p>P</p></em>\\n<sub><em><p>k</p></em></sub>\\n<sub><p>𝑃𝑘</p></sub>\\n<p>（%）</p></th><th></th></tr><tr><td>薹草+角果藜+绢蒿荒漠草原</td><td>0.35</td><td>0.37</td></tr><tr><td>伊犁绢蒿荒漠草原</td><td>0.14</td><td>0.27</td></tr><tr><td>羊茅草原</td><td>0.20</td><td>0.32</td></tr><tr><td>榆树、杨树、柳树等有林地</td><td>0.03</td><td>0.11</td></tr><tr><td>河滩湿地</td><td>0.01</td><td>0.06</td></tr><tr><td>农作物</td><td>0.12</td><td>0.25</td></tr><tr><td>Shannon-Weaver 多样性指数（H）</td><td colspan=\\"2\\">1.39</td></tr><tr><td>HBmaxB</td><td colspan=\\"2\\">1.79</td></tr></tbody></table>", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.4"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "p601", "type": "paragraph", "content": "对于给定的n（群落类型数），Shannon-Weaver指数有最大值HBmaxB，此时，各群落类型的面积比例相同，而且各群落斑块在景观中分布的均匀程度最大。通过上表可知，Shannon-Weaver多样性指数（H）等于1.39，占HBmaxB的77.43%，说明评价范围内群落多样性程度较高。", "section_path": ["1", "1.4", "1.4.9.4"], "section_title": ""}, {"id": "t1", "rows": [["年平均气温", "℃", "9.2", "9.1"], 